325
00:13:25.282 --> 00:13:27.545
&lt;i&gt;Cerritos&lt;/i&gt; قوية!

326
00:13:27.588 --> 00:13:29.808
&lt;i&gt;Oh, and the ballroom dancing competition&lt;/i&gt;

327
00:13:29.852 --> 00:13:31.027
&lt;i&gt;يجب إلغاء التأخير.&lt;/i&gt;

